Z||000000||JayUSA77||06-26-2001||04:09 PM||||Does anyone know of a transaxle that can withstand 550 HP regardless of the gear ratio.  I need a street tranne that wont blow to shreds if i floor it.  Please help me as much as you can. Thanks||||reg||4
Z||000001||AkursedX||06-26-2001||04:14 PM||||Well, I think you would be hard-pressed to find one.  Your best bet would be a Getrag 5-speed, or maybe a BUILT 3 speed or 4speed from a 3800S/C.  <P>But on a sidenote, your tranny might not be the weak point when running that kind of hp.  It might actually be the cradle.  I remember hearing about a 700+hp Fiero that ripped the motor mounts right through the cradle!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif">  <P>But, I think 550hp can be done, but it'll be alot of work, and probably alot of cash<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Slammed Fiero||06-26-2001||04:19 PM||||Why are you posting questions about a Camaro to a FIERO forum??<P><BR>I just caught this off of another thread , but you say you have a camaro.<P>the only issue with 550hp and a 6spd is the clutch. There is a conversion kit out there for a big block in a c4 , they say all you need to change is the clutch. <P>JM<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000003||Will||06-26-2001||04:37 PM||||What thread would that be?<P>A built Toronado transaxle might do it.<P>If not that, you're going to have to do a longitudinal conversion and use a Porsche transaxle.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Slammed Fiero||06-26-2001||04:42 PM||||read the v8 gear ratio thread. The guy has 94 corvette running NOS.\<P>JM ||||reg||1
Z||000005||Steve Normington||06-26-2001||05:34 PM||||If he's using the terminology right, he can't be talking about a Camaro. A transaxle is only for a FWD/RERWD car. A Camaro would use a transmission and differential.||||reg||1
Z||000006||88formula||06-26-2001||09:05 PM||||The transaxle used on the Cadillac Northstar Motor is a beast. If you don’t mind dealing with electronic controls maybe you could use that one.<P>These guys would know! <A HREF="http://www.thrasher-ep.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.thrasher-ep.com</A>   <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
